 "summary": "The HMW87 and HMW87D are the RS-485 Modbus RTU members of the Vaisala HMDW80 wall transmitter family (the D version has a display). This map covers humidity, temperature and calculated readings in float and integer form, status, filtering, serial and display settings and test registers.",
